# Name: Sunflower
# Use: Brown centre disc with yellow petal loops
# Machine support: petal chain runs now; centre rounds need a rotating work holder
# Assembly: attach petals around the centre by hand
CH 6
JOIN
ROUND 12
ROUND 24
ROUND 36
PAUSE Swap to yellow yarn
CH 96 # 12 petals of 8 chains each
PAUSE Attach petals around the centre
